---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';

const name = SITE_CONFIG.name;
---

<InfoLayout
  title="Contact"
  description={`Contact ${name}: report a bug, suggest a new image tool, or ask a question about privacy.`}
  path="contact"
>
  <p>Questions, bug reports and ideas for new tools are all welcome.</p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}`} class="text-[20px] font-semibold">{SITE_CONFIG.contactEmail}</a>
  </p>
  <p>Every message is read, but replies can take a few days.</p>

  <h2>Bugs and feature requests</h2>
  <p>
    You can also open an issue on <a href={SITE_CONFIG.issuesUrl} rel="noopener">GitHub</a>, where you can follow progress and see
    what others have asked for.
  </p>
  <p>To help fix a problem quickly, please include:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>the tool's name or its page address;</li>
    <li>your device, browser and its version (for example "Android, Chrome 141");</li>
    <li>what you did, what you expected, and what happened instead.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Please don't send photos that contain personal information. The tools never need your files to be fixed, and the steps are usually
    enough.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy questions</h2>
  <p>See the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, or email the address above.</p>
</InfoLayout>
